Z||000000||gabriel||04-25-2001||02:46 PM||||  Has anyone else here completely relocated the gas tank?  <BR>  I'm thinking of removing the tunnel.  <BR>  I'm quite sure that steel will have to be added to reinforce the area.<BR>Perhaps the tank can be relocated in the trunk space.<BR>  Has anyone done this mod?||||reg||1
