Z||000003||EdsB52||04-25-2001||03:18 PM||||Why remove the tunnel? Are you going with a bench seat? Where will you relocate the shifter? Do you realize the amount of steel plate that would have to be added to compensate for the loss of that tunnel, based on the shape of the tunnel?||||reg||1
